<section class="section">
  <div class="container stack">
    <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>Safety equipment</h3><p>Every passenger travels with a <strong>life vest</strong>. We also carry extra vests for those who want to swim with the sea lions, plus wetsuits (limited stock) in the colder season.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>No swimming ability required</h3><p>You can enter the sea wearing a life vest. Our crew stays with you throughout the stop to swim with the sea lions.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>Crew &amp; navigation equipment</h3><p>An experienced crew and sophisticated onboard equipment: GPS, radar, echo sounder, radio beacon, life rafts and the relevant pyrotechnics (signal and smoke flares).</p></div></div>
    <div class="card card--top-gold"><div class="card__body"><h3>On board</h3><p>We give every passenger a free seasickness tablet at the start of the trip. Following our recommendations, getting seasick is unlikely.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body"><h3>Travel insurance</h3><p>All passengers are <strong>insured</strong> throughout the voyage.</p></div></div>
